.SH NAME
featureKeys \- get all feature key names
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fIfeatureKeys(\fBfeatures\fR as any, 
[\fB<Environment>\fR]);\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
get all feature key names
.PP
.SH OPTIONS
.PP
\fBfeatures\fB \fR\- a collection of the genbank feature object or a genbank clr object.. 
.PP
.PP
\fBenv\fB \fR\- the R# runtime environment object.. 
.PP
.SH VALUE
.PP
a character vector of the feature key name;
 
 this function returns a R# error message object if the input features 
 data can not be cast to a collection of the genbank feature object.
.PP
